  "2026-08-11T04:51:34.734Z",pi-agent,"buildAncestry now takes a strict boolean: promoteGeneration passes true (unresolvable collection run -> provenance_unreadable CONFLICT naming run id + generation); renderLineageCommand passes false (tolerant, degraded view still renders). countPromotedUnderApproval refuses an uncountable Generation (budget_undecidable CONFLICT) naming the id and why (no fence / unparseable spec); id-less listed rows are still skipped. Tests: an unresolvable run refuses promotion while lineage renders; a no-fence and a bad-fence generation each refuse promotion while lineage renders; the prior budget test no longer seeds unparseable generations."
